  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "31197376",
      "title": "Making Content Scrollable with ScrollView",
      "lectureOrder": 25,
      "videoOrder": 22,
      "sourceHash": "b83faa42e502554785e55a7c2e5e069572cf70f99dd7bd0cc115210242929a09",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.07,
          "end": 4.41,
          "en": "So we got our list here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.41,
          "end": 8.47,
          "en": "Now, one thing you will notice about this list",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.47,
          "end": 12.08,
          "en": "is that if I add more and more items here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 12.996,
          "end": 16.13,
          "en": "and I just add exclamation marks to make them unique,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 16.13,
          "end": 20.483,
          "en": "at some point we will go beyond the available space.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 21.4,
          "end": 23.94,
          "en": "Now you would expect that you simply scroll now,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 23.94,
          "end": 26.06,
          "en": "but it turns out you can't scroll.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 26.06,
          "end": 29.43,
          "en": "No matter how you try, this is not scrollable.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 29.43,
          "end": 33.94,
          "en": "Because by default the view generated here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 33.94,
          "end": 37.44,
          "en": "this view that holds everything in our app component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 37.44,
          "end": 39.45,
          "en": "is not scrollable.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 39.45,
          "end": 43.23,
          "en": "That's also a difference compared to the browser.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 43.23,
          "end": 46.26,
          "en": "On a website, if you exceed the available space",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 46.26,
          "end": 48.9,
          "en": "by default scrolling bars will appear,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 48.9,
          "end": 50.653,
          "en": "and you can scroll the website.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 51.88,
          "end": 54.24,
          "en": "This is not the case here in mobile apps.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 54.24,
          "end": 55.62,
          "en": "If you want to scroll,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 55.62,
          "end": 58.88,
          "en": "you have to explicitly tell React Native",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 58.88,
          "end": 60.713,
          "en": "and the native platforms.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 61.77,
          "end": 62.71,
          "en": "Now, of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 62.71,
          "end": 65.2,
          "en": "this is a common problem and scenario though,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 65.2,
          "end": 66.75,
          "en": "and, therefore, making lists,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 66.75,
          "end": 71.03999999999999,
          "en": "or content in general, scrollable, is very easy.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 71.03999999999999,
          "end": 74.71000000000001,
          "en": "There is a dedicated component provided by React Native",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 74.71000000000001,
          "end": 75.653,
          "en": "that helps you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 76.5,
          "end": 78.41,
          "en": "And that's the ScrollView.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 78.41,
          "end": 82.08,
          "en": "We import ScrollView from React Native just",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 82.08,
          "end": 84.803,
          "en": "as we imported text input button and so on.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 86.16,
          "end": 88.71000000000001,
          "en": "And ScrollView does what the name implies,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 88.71000000000001,
          "end": 91.74,
          "en": "It gives you a view so such a container element,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 91.74,
          "end": 93.12299999999999,
          "en": "which will be scrollable.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 94.89,
          "end": 97.28,
          "en": "And therefore we can now use this ScrollView",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 98.32,
          "end": 99.983,
          "en": "around our goals here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 101.08,
          "end": 103.93,
          "en": "So let's try replacing this view here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 103.93,
          "end": 106,
          "en": "with our ScrollView, simply.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 106,
          "end": 108.61,
          "en": "We add ScrollView here instead of view",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 108.61,
          "end": 110.93,
          "en": "around our list of goals.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 110.93,
          "end": 114.16,
          "en": "And I leave my style on this ScrollView.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 114.16,
          "end": 117.41,
          "en": "Keep in mind this style here controls",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 117.41,
          "end": 120.163,
          "en": "that this container takes up a lot of space.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 121.97,
          "end": 126.97,
          "en": "If we save this, this doesn't look too good.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 127.13,
          "end": 129.93,
          "en": "This now is indeed scrollable, as you see,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 129.93,
          "end": 133.1,
          "en": "but the space is different than it was before,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 133.1,
          "end": 134.84,
          "en": "we have way more space for the input",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 134.84,
          "end": 136.853,
          "en": "and way less space for the list.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 138.12,
          "end": 141.26,
          "en": "The reason for that is that the ScrollView has the job",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 141.26,
          "end": 145.32,
          "en": "of making something scrollable, but the area",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 145.32,
          "end": 150.04,
          "en": "that's scrollable is in the end determined by the current,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 150.04,
          "end": 152.6,
          "en": "the container that holds the ScrollView.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 153.51,
          "end": 156.98,
          "en": "So what you should do here is add another normal view,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 156.98,
          "end": 159.8,
          "en": "which restricts the available height,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 159.8,
          "end": 161.49,
          "en": "to which you then apply the style",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 161.49,
          "end": 164.963,
          "en": "that sets the height that will be taken up by that view.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 165.9,
          "end": 168.93,
          "en": "So that is the setup we had before, but now we",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 168.93,
          "end": 171.363,
          "en": "have a ScrollView inside of that view.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 173.2,
          "end": 176.79,
          "en": "So the outer view, controls how much space this area",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 176.79,
          "end": 179.02,
          "en": "of the screen should take up.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 179.02,
          "end": 181.92,
          "en": "And the inner ScrollView then makes sure that this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 181.92,
          "end": 185.42,
          "en": "space, and the items in that space, to be precise,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 185.42,
          "end": 189.223,
          "en": "will be scrollable inside that overall space.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 190.24,
          "end": 192.26,
          "en": "That's how we set up such a ScrollView,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 192.26,
          "end": 195.923,
          "en": "and how we let it interact with the surrounding container.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 197.19,
          "end": 199.76,
          "en": "If we set it up like this and we save everything,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 199.76,
          "end": 202.09,
          "en": "we get the same proportions as before,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 202.09,
          "end": 206.313,
          "en": "but now, indeed, as you see, this list is scrollable here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 207.36,
          "end": 208.65,
          "en": "And that's, of course, what we want,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 208.65,
          "end": 210.18,
          "en": "because now we have a list",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 210.18,
          "end": 213.06,
          "en": "where we can add more and more items",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 213.06,
          "end": 217.123,
          "en": "and it stays scrollable as we exceed the available space.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 218.01,
          "end": 220.86,
          "en": "Of course, if I force a reload,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 220.86,
          "end": 223.94,
          "en": "by pressing R here in the terminal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 223.94,
          "end": 226.22,
          "en": "And I then go back, all the data is lost,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 226.22,
          "end": 229.26,
          "en": "and now you see, nothing seems to be scrollable here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 229.26,
          "end": 231.963,
          "en": "If I add a single goal here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 233.46,
          "end": 234.66,
          "en": "we do see, though,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 234.66,
          "end": 236.44,
          "en": "that this is indeed scrollable,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 236.44,
          "end": 238.86,
          "en": "but of course it's not really scrollable,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 238.86,
          "end": 241.11,
          "en": "It always jumps back to the top because",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 241.11,
          "end": 243.063,
          "en": "we don't exceed the available height.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 244.39,
          "end": 248.37,
          "en": "So, ScrollView is super useful because it does allow you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 248.37,
          "end": 252.663,
          "en": "to make lists, or content in general, scrollable.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 254.06,
          "end": 256.47,
          "en": "Now you can learn more about ScrollView",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 256.47,
          "end": 259.383,
          "en": "and the props it supports in the official docs.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 260.44,
          "end": 263.95,
          "en": "I wanna draw your attention to those props here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 263.95,
          "end": 266.17,
          "en": "because there is a lot you can configure,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 266.17,
          "end": 267.71,
          "en": "about the ScrollView.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 267.71,
          "end": 271.113,
          "en": "You can, for example, configure how it bounces,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 272.15,
          "end": 275.89,
          "en": "and you'll also see that some props are specific to iOS.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 275.89,
          "end": 278.57,
          "en": "And others specific to Android,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 278.57,
          "end": 282.293,
          "en": "whilst yet others are available for both platforms.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 283.13,
          "end": 285.88,
          "en": "And again, these are some of these platform differences,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 285.88,
          "end": 287.38,
          "en": "which we will encounter here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 287.38,
          "end": 289.36,
          "en": "and then throughout this course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 289.36,
          "end": 291.34000000000003,
          "en": "For example, you will notice",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 291.34000000000003,
          "end": 293.99,
          "en": "that in our app here, I can scroll",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 293.99,
          "end": 296.77,
          "en": "and I have this bouncing effect.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 296.77,
          "end": 298.86,
          "en": "If I would want to disable this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 298.86,
          "end": 301.96,
          "en": "I could set always bounce vertical,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 301.96,
          "end": 305.803,
          "en": "which is true by default, to false.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 308.261,
          "end": 309.74,
          "en": "So if I go to ScrollView,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 309.74,
          "end": 313.17,
          "en": "and I set always bounce vertical to false,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 313.17,
          "end": 317.22,
          "en": "and I then save this, you will notice that here in iOS,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 317.22,
          "end": 318.44,
          "en": "if I now try to scroll,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 318.44,
          "end": 321.39300000000003,
          "en": "this bouncing effect, which we had before, is gone.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 322.69,
          "end": 325.11,
          "en": "Now, if I add more and more goals to make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 325.11,
          "end": 329.26,
          "en": "that I exceed the available space here, at some point,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 329.26,
          "end": 330.93,
          "en": "it still is scrollable,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 330.93,
          "end": 333.81,
          "en": "and now it also bounces, but it didn't bounce,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 333.81,
          "end": 337.81,
          "en": "if there was not enough content to fill the available space,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 337.81,
          "end": 339.313,
          "en": "the available height here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 340.54,
          "end": 343.75,
          "en": "If you do want to set this or not as totally up to you and",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 343.75,
          "end": 346.56,
          "en": "which look and feel you want, but it is important to",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 346.56,
          "end": 350.31,
          "en": "be aware of the vast configuration options you have here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 350.31,
          "end": 354.26,
          "en": "And therefore taking a look at those props here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 354.26,
          "end": 356.37,
          "en": "and understanding what you can set",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 356.37,
          "end": 358.7,
          "en": "and how you can use this view is definitely",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 358.7,
          "end": 360.6,
          "en": "something I would encourage you to do",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 360.6,
          "end": 363.15,
          "en": "because every app you're building will be different",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 363.15,
          "end": 367.04,
          "en": "and every app needs slightly different configuration.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 367.04,
          "end": 368.86,
          "en": "And therefore the official docs are always",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 368.86,
          "end": 371.69,
          "en": "a great place where you can find all kinds",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 371.69,
          "end": 373.963,
          "en": "of supported configuration settings.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
